sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (Next.js)
    participant A as API /v1/auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Redis

    Note over B,A: Login
    B->>A: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    A->>R: rate-limit check (IP + email)
    A->>DB: find user, argon2.verify(hash)
    A->>DB: insert RefreshToken (hash, familyId)
    A-->>B: 200 {accessToken (15m)} + Set-Cookie refresh_token<br/>(HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Lax, Path=/v1/auth)
    Note over B: access token kept in memory only

    Note over B,A: Authenticated call
    B->>A: GET /v1/orgs/:orgId/tasks<br/>Authorization: Bearer <access>
    A-->>B: 200 tasks

    Note over B,A: Access token expired → silent refresh
    B->>A: POST /auth/refresh (cookie sent automatically)
    A->>DB: lookup by sha256(token)
    alt token valid and not revoked
        A->>DB: revoke old, insert new (same familyId, replacedById)
        A-->>B: 200 {new accessToken} + rotated cookie
    else token already revoked (REUSE = theft signal)
        A->>DB: revoke ENTIRE family
        A-->>B: 401 → force re-login
    end

    Note over B,A: Logout
    B->>A: POST /auth/logout
    A->>DB: revoke token family
    A-->>B: 204 + clear cookie
